          </div>
<span style="font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--text);">Meridian</span>
</div>
<nav style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; height: 56px;">
<a href="#" style="font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);">Today's routes</a>
<a href="#" style="font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center;">Pending work</a>
</nav>
