          </p>
</div>
<div style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted);">
          Total allocated: <span class="font-mono" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);">20</span> packs across <span class="font-mono" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);">2</span> boxes
        </div>
</div>
<!-- Table -->
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left;">
